      "127.0.0.1 only; Host allowlist blocks DNS rebinding",
      "Origin + X-Requested-With block CSRF to localhost",
      "Remote mode needs ALLOW_REMOTE + HTTPS, one address",
      "Device logins in memory for one job, never stored" ] },
    { "dot": "emerald", "title": "Safe push", "items": [
      "Commands hash frozen at create; re-checked at run",
      "Production: a different admin approves within 24 h",
      "Device-side timer: revert / commit confirmed / checkpoint",
      "Changed SSH host key stops before the password is sent" ] },
    { "dot": "cyan", "title": "Optional and test seams", "items": [
